OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of acres of farmland to
OL,4,Abecome salt marsh
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planning application to turn hundreds
OL,7,Fof acres of farmland back into salt
OL,8,Fmarsh has been submitted by a national
OL,9,Fcharity.
OL,11,FAbout 365 acres (148 hectares) of
OL,12,Flow-lying land on the Awre peninsula,
OL,13,Fin the Forest of Dean in
OL,14,FGloucestershire, was bought by the
OL,15,FWildfowl and Wetlands Trust (WWT) in
OL,16,FDecember 2024.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
