OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1794403558
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of acres of farmland to
OL,4,Abecome salt marsh
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the trust, a salt marsh
OL,7,Fwas "present on the site centuries ago"
OL,8,Fand it has now applied to the Forest of
OL,9,FDean District Council to breach the sea
OL,10,Fwall and allow salt water back onto the
OL,11,Fland.
OL,13,FThe application, which also includes
OL,14,Fbuilding a new flood defence, ponds and
OL,15,Fcreeks and changing some public
OL,16,Ffootpaths, is due to go out for
OL,17,Fconsultation at the end of the month.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
